#: src/pages/settings/applications/utils/getStandardApplicationDescription.ts
#. js-lingui-id: HP7per
msgid ""
"The base data model every Twenty workspace runs on.\n"
"\n"
"#### What \"foundation\" means\n"
"\n"
"Every Twenty workspace starts with this set of objects. They define the shape of your CRM, including relationships, activity, and reporting. Everything else, including marketplace apps, AI agents, and custom objects, plugs into them.\n"
"\n"
"#### Included objects\n"
"- **People & Companies**: contact and account records\n"
"- **Opportunities**: your sales pipeline\n"
"- **Notes & Tasks**: activity and follow-ups\n"
"- **Workflows & Dashboards**: automation and reporting\n"
"\n"
"Remove this app and the rest of Twenty has nothing to hang off.\n"
"\n"
"#### Build your own app\n"
"\n"
"Extend Twenty with your own objects, fields, logic functions, or AI skills. Scaffold a new app in one command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Then inside the folder:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"cd my-twenty-app\n"
"yarn twenty dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"See the [Getting Started guide](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/getting-started) for the full walkthrough, and [Building Apps](https://twenty.com/developers/extend/apps/building) for the `defineApplication` / `defineEntity` APIs."
msgstr ""
"Le modèle de données de base sur lequel fonctionne chaque espace de travail CloseAI.\n"
"\n"
"#### Ce que signifie « socle »\n"
"\n"
"Chaque espace de travail CloseAI commence avec cet ensemble d'objets. Ils définissent la structure de votre CRM, y compris les relations, l'activité et le reporting. Tout le reste, y compris les applications de la marketplace, les agents IA et les objets personnalisés, s'y connecte.\n"
"\n"
"#### Objets inclus\n"
"- **Personnes & Entreprises**: enregistrements de contacts et de comptes\n"
"- **Opportunités**: votre pipeline commercial\n"
"- **Notes & Tâches**: activité et suivis\n"
"- **Flux de travail & Tableaux de bord**: automatisation et reporting\n"
"\n"
"Supprimez cette application et le reste de CloseAI n'a plus rien sur quoi s'appuyer.\n"
"\n"
"#### Créez votre propre application\n"
"\n"
"Étendez CloseAI avec vos propres objets, champs, fonctions logiques ou compétences en IA. Initialisez une nouvelle application en une commande :\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npx create-twenty-app@latest my-twenty-app\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Ensuite, dans le dossier :\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"cd my-twenty-app\n"
"yarn twenty dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Consultez le [Guide de démarrage](https://app.closeai.pt) pour le tutoriel complet, et [Création d'applications](https://app.closeai.pt) pour les API `defineApplication` / `defineEntity`."

